  "body": "This version extraction is inconsistent with other scripts. Most other scripts handle epoch versions using `sed 's/^[0-9]\\+://'` to remove the epoch prefix (e.g., '1:' from '1:1.4-1'), but this script doesn't handle epochs.\n```suggestion\nUPSTREAM_VERSION=$(pacman -Ss '^opus$' | awk '{print $2; exit}' | cut -d- -f1 | sed 's/^[0-9]\\+://')\n```",
